{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02994","headline":"感遇十二首 六 · 张九龄","name":"感遇十二首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西日下山隐，北风乘夕流。\n燕雀感昏旦，檐楹呼匹俦。\n鸿鹄虽自远，哀音非所求。\n贵人弃疵贱，下士尝殷忧。\n衆情累外物，恕己忘内修。\n感叹长如此，使我心悠悠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02994.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02994","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}